  <Properties>
    <articleTitle>
      <Value Culture="en"><![CDATA[He wanted to test the car's capabilities, the incident on the ski slope]]></Value>
      <Value Culture="pl-PL"><![CDATA[Chciał sprawdzić możliwości auta, incydent na stoku narciarskim]]></Value>
    </articleTitle>
    <author>
      <Value><![CDATA[umb://document/833364f91e1e4f9a866584920b87dfba]]></Value>
    </author>
    <components>
      <Value Culture="en"><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "bc8cfc9b-08fe-4be1-8a61-49c6dedf32ba",
      "key": "c371a80e-d93d-4e31-8f91-c44d679d8023",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "componentText",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EWe contacted the Municipal Headquarters of the State Fire Service in Wa\u0142brzych regarding this matter.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u0022We received a report at 12:23 AM. The driver, a 40-year-old man, attempted to drive an off-road vehicle up the Dzikowiec slope, where a ski lift is located. In one place, it\u0027s the steepest slope in Poland, making it difficult to drive. The vehicle lost traction and began to somersault about 200 meters downhill,\u0022 reported Senior Captain Tomasz Kwiatkowski.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EWe contacted the Municipal Headquarters of the State Fire Service in Wa\u0142brzych regarding this matter.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u0022We received a report at 12:23 AM. The driver, a 40-year-old man, attempted to drive an off-road vehicle up the Dzikowiec slope, where a ski lift is located. In one place, it\u0027s the steepest slope in Poland, making it difficult to drive. The vehicle lost traction and began to somersault about 200 meters downhill,\u0022 reported Senior Captain Tomasz Kwiatkowski. We contacted the Municipal Headquarters of the State Fire Service in Wa\u0142brzych regarding this matter.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "settingsData": [
    {
